## What is Sawmill?

Sawmill is a terminal log analysis tool for working with structured tool logs. Plugins teach Sawmill how to parse
tool-specific log formats. The **plugin is the sole source of truth** — the base app has zero
hardcoded knowledge about log formats or severity levels.

