## Entry Point

The plugin is registered in `pyproject.toml`:

```toml
[project.entry-points."sawmill.plugins"]
{{ entry_point_key }} = "{{ module_name }}:{{ class_name }}"
```

After `make install`, Sawmill discovers the plugin automatically.
